<title>PORTUGAL: WestLB launches 10 bln esc 10-yr Navigator.</title>
<headline>WestLB launches 10 bln esc 10-yr Navigator.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>WestLB Finance Curacao launched a 10 billion escudos 10-year &quot;step up&quot; Navigator, at 6.2 percent in the first year and rising by 0.1 percentage points each year, joint leaders Banco Cisf and Caixa Geral de Depositos said.</p>
<p>The issue is guaranteed by Westdeutsche Landesbank Girozentrale (WestLB).</p>
</text>
